<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

	<PropertyGroup>
		<TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.1;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
		<AssemblyName>obs-websocket-dotnet</AssemblyName>
		<RootNamespace>OBSWebsocketDotNet</RootNamespace>
		<Copyright>Copyright © BarRaider 2025</Copyright>
		<LangVersion>8</LangVersion>
		<Version>5.7.0</Version>
		<Authors>BarRaider</Authors>
		<PackageLicenseFile>LICENSE</PackageLicenseFile>
		<PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/BarRaider/obs-websocket-dotnet</PackageProjectUrl>
		<RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/BarRaider/obs-websocket-dotnet</RepositoryUrl>
		<Description>Official obs-websocket .NET library. Written in C#. Supports .NET Standard 2.1 and .NET 10.</Description>
		<PackageTags>OBS obs-websocket websocket official obs-websocket-dotnet obs.websocket.net obs-websocket-net netstandard2.1 net10</PackageTags>
		<GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
		<PackageReleaseNotes>What's new in v5.7.0
* Brings the library up to date with the obs-websocket 5.7.0 protocol: 8 new events (CustomEvent, InputSettingsChanged, SourceFilterSettingsChanged, RecordFileChanged, ScreenshotSaved, CanvasCreated, CanvasRemoved, CanvasNameChanged) and 17 new requests (generic Outputs, recording directory/split/chapter, input deinterlacing, GetSourceFilterKindList, GetSceneItemSource, GetCanvasList)
* Event subscription control via EventSubscriptions, including opt-in for high-volume events
* Multi-target netstandard2.1 and net10.0; tests and TestClient moved from net9 to net10
* Fixed GetInputAudioTracks always returning false for every track
* IOBSWebsocket now declares OpenSourceProjector, OpenVideoMixProjector, and every event/request added above (implementers of IOBSWebsocket will need to add these members)
* Greatly expanded test suite: request/response round-trip coverage plus conformance gates that catch drift from the protocol spec

</PackageReleaseNotes>
	</PropertyGroup>

	<PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Release|AnyCPU'">
	  <DocumentationFile>obs-websocket-dotnet.xml</DocumentationFile>
	</PropertyGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
	  <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions" Version="10.0.12" />
	  <PackageReference Include="Newtonsoft.Json" Version="13.0.4" />
	  <PackageReference Include="Websocket.Client" Version="5.1.2" />
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
	  <None Include="..\LICENSE">
	    <Pack>True</Pack>
	    <PackagePath></PackagePath>
	  </None>
	</ItemGroup>

</Project>